Constructed meaning c04_1 (passage 5, inferred): Jim's fixed stare, revealed as stunned struggle to absorb Della's shorn hair rather than rejection, meets her prayed fear of seeming no longer pretty with his claim that no haircut could lessen his love, separating devotion from appearance.
